              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tena itakuwa katika siku hiyo mabaki ya Israeli, na hao waliopona wa nyumba ya Yakobo, hawatamtegemea tena yeye aliyewapiga, bali watamtegemea BWANA, Mtakatifu wa Israeli, kwa kweli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mabaki, nao ni mabaki ya Yakobo, watamrudia Mungu, aliye mwenye nguvu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
